            discardConfig: 'Cards are built onto foundations or shifted within the tableau; no discard pile is used.',
            specialCards: 'Cards contribute only their rank and suit values to foundations; no card has a secondary effect.',
            declarationMechanism: 'Victory is determined by the physical placement of 52 cards on foundations; no declaration phase exists.',
            fishingConfig: 'Beleaguered Castle is a packing solitaire and does not use a capture-from-tableau fishing mechanic.',
            trickConfig: 'The game is a solitaire puzzle rather than a competitive trick-taking or climbing game.',
            shedding: 'Beleaguered Castle is a packing solitaire; the goal is to build foundations, not to empty the hand.',
